number of irreducible representations: 6 = order of the group: 6
all irreducible representations are one-dimensional: True
the character with j = 1 is k -> exp(2 pi i k / 6); its values on k = 0..5: [1, 1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2, (1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2)^2, (1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2)^3, (1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2)^4, (1/2*I*sqrt(3) + 1/2)^5]
